Package: org.rustica.texteditor
Version: 1.0.1
Architecture: x86_64
Kind: app
Maintainer: The Rustux Authors <gitrustux@rustux>
Homepage: https://rustux.com
License: MIT
Description: Text Editor
 Rustica's Text Editor: one text file at a time. Files opens a file with
 it; Open and Save as ask with the file chooser, so it needs no
 permission to your folders.
